  "scope": "Expose the snapshot-bound, journaled note rename operation through the native egui UI with asynchronous preview/apply, visible reference decisions, explicit confirmation, and refreshed note listings.",
  "behavior": [
    "The UI selects a Markdown note from the current vault listing and builds a read-only rename preview on a Rayon worker.",
    "The preview displays proposed reference updates and labels ambiguous or unresolved references as unchanged; at most 100 reference rows are rendered, with the remaining count reported.",
    "Applying requires review and a separate confirmation, runs asynchronously, uses the existing snapshot-bound journaled transaction, and refreshes the session listing after commit.",
    "A stale preview or existing destination is rejected with an actionable message. Failed applies invalidate the preview so the user must build and review a fresh one.",
    "A focused UI test verifies the update, ambiguous-skip and unresolved-skip labels."
  ],
